# Intent: Sleepy and sleeping are now two different looks. SLEEPY has no Z at all (no bubble and no floating letters) and nods off and fights to stay awake: a slow irregular loop of six steps (the eyes hold on, droop, shut for a moment, snap wide open, settle, a half droop it catches) with random step lengths; face only, no head motion. SLEEPING keeps the eyes shut and now snores (the mouth slowly opens and closes with a small puff that rises and fades) and now and then a drool drop slides down from the corner of the mouth; the floating z letters (the zzz overlay, fixed zones and the governor unchanged) belong to sleeping and closing only. Low battery stays the tired look. Also (patch UI09): the Wi-Fi page (title Wi-Fi: the current network and its signal, up to three saved networks with a 44 px connect target, Done, swipe down) and the registration of the quick settings panel with the single screen state.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_look_core.h (ours, V10 and later), stackchan_display.cc SetEmotion, maipai_fx.cc maipai_fx_note_emotion (TA03)
